  "content": {
    "id": "p10-q7-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "A ribbon that is 20 m long is to be divided into lengths of $\\frac58$ of a metre. How many such lengths are there?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "32 lengths",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}20\\div\\frac58&=20\\times\\frac85\\\\20\\div\\frac58&=32\\end{align*}$$\n\nThere are 32 lengths, each $\\frac58$ m long.",
